# Your OpenAI-compatible API key (despite the var name) -- used for resume
# parsing, job-fit scoring, and tailored answers. You can leave this blank
# and set a key from the web app's Settings tab instead (BYOK); a key saved
# there always takes priority over this one.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# LinkedIn, Wellfound, Ashby, Workable, and Rippling logins are never typed
# in here -- there's no automated-login credential field for any platform.
# LinkedIn/Wellfound need a one-time manual login in a real browser window
# (see the README's "First-time login per platform"), which saves a
# session to auth_state/<platform>.json. Ashby/Workable/Rippling are guest
# apply and need no login at all.
